---
description: Do not duplicate apps, keys, or dump default catalogs when adding Design or Finance
alwaysApply: true
---

# One module, one owner

| Concern | Where |
|---|---|
| Invoices, customers, invoice print, payments flags | `hub/src/components/invoices/` — **done** |
| Labels, templates, prepress, `label_assets/` | `hub/src/components/design/` — **native, three tools** (see `docs/DESIGN.md`) |
| Stock, prep, P&L, catalog **writes**, returns **writes** | `hub/src/components/finance/` — **native, eight tools** (see `docs/FINANCE.md`) |
| Auth, CloudStore, brand, workspace shell | existing hub files — import, do not copy |

Do not add a second invoice list, customer book, or catalog CRUD inside Design. Do not reimplement `InvoiceProvider` for stickers.

New app = new folder + `writeXKey` guard (mirror `writeInvoiceKey`). Shared color presets are one `bb_color_presets` list.

# No dumps

Never seed `DEFAULT_PRODUCTS`, `DEFAULT_CATEGORIES`, HTML gold themes, or empty invoice arrays into Firestore because the cloud key is missing. Workspace **Soon** actions must not write.

Pending cards skip `kind: 'invoice_draft'`. Do not mix prep-approve with production-approve.

# Design slice

Native Library / Studio / Print house. Waves A–D on `main`. Do **not** copy sticker HTML into `public/` or iframe it. Do not add a Theme tab that duplicates Invoices Look. Do not seed templates or flavor packs into Firestore. Map: `docs/DESIGN.md`.

# Finance slice

Native eight tools (overview / invoices / stock / flow / purchases / recipes / returns / ops). Do **not** copy Stock Costs HTML into `public/` or iframe it. Do not add a Theme tab. Do not write `bb_label_templates` or seed catalogs. Prep-approve is the only `bb_invoices` write — `commitPrepInvoice` may touch `FINANCE_PREP_APPEND_KEYS` only; do **not** add `bb_invoices` to `FINANCE_WRITE_KEYS`. Map: `docs/FINANCE.md`.
